## 3. SEO Checklist Before Deployment

1. **Images Alt Text (`alt="..."`):** Ensure the `alt` tag inside the `<img>` tags describes exactly what the clothing is (e.g., `alt="Premium 260g Heavyweight Boxy Fit Tee"`). Google Images relies heavily on this to bring you organic traffic.
2. **Match URL Slugs:** Ensure the file names (`spring-style.md`, `summer-style.md`, etc.) perfectly match your internal links at the bottom of each article so you don't create broken 404 links.
3. **No Hidden Dates:** Since you chose to hide post/update dates, these pages will act as **Evergreen SEO Content**, meaning they will continue to look fresh to users searching for fashion tips months or years from now.